<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"nfd-gap-sm\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\"}} --><div class=\"nfd-gap-sm wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontStyle\":\"normal\",\"fontWeight\":\"500\"}},\"className\":\"wp-block-heading nfd-text-md nfd-text-contrast\"} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading nfd-text-md nfd-text-contrast\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:500\">How do I download the app?</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"nfd-text-faded nfd-text-base\"} --><p class=\"nfd-text-faded nfd-text-base\">Simply visit our website and click on the \'Download Now\' button to get the app up and running.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"nfd-gap-sm\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\"}} --><div class=\"nfd-gap-sm wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontStyle\":\"normal\",\"fontWeight\":\"500\"}},\"className\":\"wp-block-heading nfd-text-md nfd-text-contrast\"} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading nfd-text-md nfd-text-contrast\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:500\">Can I customize the app\'s settings?</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"nfd-text-faded nfd-text-base\"} --><p class=\"nfd-text-faded nfd-text-base\">Absolutely! With just a few clicks, you can adjust various settings to fit your preferences and needs.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"nfd-gap-sm\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\"}} --><div class=\"nfd-gap-sm wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontStyle\":\"normal\",\"fontWeight\":\"500\"}},\"className\":\"wp-block-heading nfd-text-md nfd-text-contrast\"} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading nfd-text-md nfd-text-contrast\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:500\">What happens if I need to change my login credentials?</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"nfd-text-faded nfd-text-base\"} --><p class=\"nfd-text-faded nfd-text-base\">No worries! You have the flexibility to update your login information at any time through the \'Account Settings\' section in your app.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --><!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"nfd-gap-xl nfd-gap-y-2xl\"} --><div class=\"nfd-gap-xl nfd-gap-y-2xl wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"nfd-gap-sm\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\"}} --><div class=\"nfd-gap-sm wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontStyle\":\"normal\",\"fontWeight\":\"500\"}},\"className\":\"wp-block-heading nfd-text-md nfd-text-contrast\"} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading nfd-text-md nfd-text-contrast\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:500\">How does the app handle data security?</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"nfd-text-faded nfd-text-base\"} --><p class=\"nfd-text-faded nfd-text-base\">Rest assured, we prioritize the utmost security for your data, utilizing industry-standard encryption methods to protect your information.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"nfd-gap-sm\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\"}} --><div class=\"nfd-gap-sm wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontStyle\":\"normal\",\"fontWeight\":\"500\"}},\"className\":\"wp-block-heading nfd-text-md nfd-text-contrast\"} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading nfd-text-md nfd-text-contrast\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:500\">How do I invite friends to join the app?</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"nfd-text-faded nfd-text-base\"} --><p class=\"nfd-text-faded nfd-text-base\">Our in-app messaging feature makes inviting friends a breeze! Simply head to your \'Contacts\' section, select the desired friends, and send them an invitation.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"nfd-gap-sm\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\"}} --><div class=\"nfd-gap-sm wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontStyle\":\"normal\",\"fontWeight\":\"500\"}},\"className\":\"wp-block-heading nfd-text-md nfd-text-contrast\"} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading nfd-text-md nfd-text-contrast\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:500\">Is it possible to receive an invoice for my software purchase?</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"nfd-text-faded nfd-text-base\"} --><p class=\"nfd-text-faded nfd-text-base\">Absolutely! Simply reach out to our customer support team with your purchase number and they will gladly assist you in obtaining an invoice.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"0px\",\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"flexSize\":\"40px\",\"selfStretch\":\"fixed\"}}} --><div style=\"height:0px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div><!-- /wp:spacer --><!-- wp:group {\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"Call to Action\"},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"900px\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group nfd-container\" ><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"nfd-p-card-md nfd-rounded nfd-gap-xl nfd-shadow-xs\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"wrap\",\"justifyContent\":\"space-between\"},\"nfdGroupTheme\":\"white\",\"nfdGroupEffect\":\"\"} --><div class=\"nfd-p-card-md nfd-gap-xl nfd-shadow-xs wp-block-group nfd-bg-